name: Erratic Four Spike — many 4s
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Fours, a 25% rank spike for Hack,
  Walkie Talkie, Even Steven, and X-of-a-kind hands. RAG aliases: erratic fours,
  many 4s, low-card pile, Walkie Talkie seed, four-of-a-kind start.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Four
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: Hack
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 50
  - joker: WalkieTalkie
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: EvenSteven
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Four/Five of a Kind payoff from Four density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
